 "sections": [
  {
   "level": 3,
   "heading": "About Center",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "p",
     "text": "CAPS provides effective and coordinated alcohol and drug prevention, intervention, and treatment services for children, youth, and families living in Chilliwack. We follow a bio-psycho-social-spiritual model that aims to meet the individual seeking service where they are at, with a non-judgemental and compassionate view. People will be assessed and heard concerning their needs, then matched with the appropriate service. Individual counselling is offered to people negotiating goal focused plans. Group counselling, office-based and outreach counselling are also offered.",
     "html": "CAPS provides effective and coordinated alcohol and drug prevention, intervention, and treatment services for children, youth, and families living in Chilliwack. We follow a bio-psycho-social-spiritual model that aims to meet the individual seeking service where they are at, with a non-judgemental and compassionate view. People will be assessed and heard concerning their needs, then matched with the appropriate service. Individual counselling is offered to people negotiating goal focused plans. Group counselling, office-based and outreach counselling are also offered.",
